{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le12ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter, did you get my e-mail? I forwarded you an online brochure I got the other day. I thought you might be interested. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, I'm just looking at it now ... <br/>\u201c... wildlife enforcement officers make a difference. They work to protect our environment on a daily basis. Nations work together  controlling the illicit trade of endangered species. This international trafficking of wildlife happens worldwide. Our officers make sure that offenders cannot avoid punishment by simply crossing into another country.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"></span>Wildlife enforcement officers endeavor to protect those plant and animal species which are threatened again and again through the unlawful actions by hunters and poachers.  These actions include:<ul><li>The poaching of migratory birds </li><li>The killing of endangered species </li><li>The trafficking of endangered species </li><li>The illegal importing or exporting of wildlife</li></ul><br> I'm not sure what you are trying to tell me Sally. Are you saying that I should be a wildlife enforcement officer?", "id": 2, "time": "27000"}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know you must be bored with your job right now ... Why not consider something that can make a difference in the world? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hmmm, your work must be exciting for you as well, since you're taking the time to try and find me another career path! How's that working for you?", "id": 3, "time": "51000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about nature and the animal world.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can show that I understand someone's feelings. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What public issues are important to you? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " If you could tell the public something important, what would it be? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification or use rhetorical questions to emphasize a point. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "A Public Service Announcement", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nSally talks to Peter about a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">PSA</span> she recently read. What is it about?\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": 